    "Overview": "Kozmik Klothing founded by Paula Wallace and Chalice Malcolm The transition of graffiti from \"vandalism\" to high-street and high-fashion staple began with a few pioneering designers and was rapidly scaled by athletic and \"urban\" brands between 1980 and 1994. These brands built their identity around graffiti tags, bubble letters, and the gritty visual palette of the city."
